[node name="TitleLabel" type="Label" parent="Panel/VBoxContainer"]
mouse_filter = 2
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 22
text = "How To Play"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="ContentLabel" type="Label" parent="Panel/VBoxContainer"]
mouse_filter = 2
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
theme_override_constants/line_spacing = 8
autowrap_mode = 3
text = "Move: WASD or Arrow Keys

Select Crop: number keys 1-5,
or open the Inventory (I)

In the Inventory: W/S to choose a crop,
Enter/Space to select it

Plant: Space
(on an owned, empty plot)

Harvest: E
(on a fully grown or decaying crop — sells it for money)

Unlock a Plot: E
(on a locked plot, if you can afford it)

Shop: click the yellow Shop building
to unlock new crop types, or buy an
Auto Harvester / Auto Planter upgrade

In the Shop Menu: W/S to choose an item,
Enter/Space to buy, Click/E/Esc to close

Place an Upgrade: pick it from the
Inventory (I), then press E on a plot
(gold border = Auto Harvester,
green border = Auto Planter)

Auto Harvester: harvests its plot's crop
the instant it peaks, before it decays

Auto Planter: needs an Auto Harvester
on the same plot first; press Q on that
plot to choose which crop it replants"

[node name="CloseHintLabel" type="Label" parent="Panel/VBoxContainer"]
mouse_filter = 2
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 13
text = "Click / E / Esc / H: close"
horizontal_alignment = 1
